{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Purr\u00a0Plate</i></strong>\u00a0\u2013 Craft Your Wholesome Feline Picnic Paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come and build your dream <i>Purr Plate</i>!</strong><br>In this sunlit feline paradise, become the owner of a one-of-a-kind restaurant designed with your dream &quot;Purr Plate&quot;! Team up with over 100+ quirky cat staffers--from paw-kneading bakers to servers tumbling adorably over their own tails--to create your purrfect woodland caf\u00e9!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/47c450a1269732c371138b322dfff83d.avif?t=1768972687\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras_big/47c450a1269732c371138b322dfff83d.avif?t=1768972687 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Whimsical Haven</strong><br>Start from scratch using 50+ modular components:<br>\ud83d\udc3e Combine rustic log kitchens with floating cloud-shaped dining platforms<br>\ud83d\udc3e Design enchanted garden nooks where fireflies illuminate heart-shaped scones<br>\ud83d\udc3e Build nap stations with dangling yarn balls for tired paws<br>Every moss-covered stone and mismatched teacup tells your unique story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Staff with Character</strong><br>Meet your unforgettable team:<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Grain</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The chubby tabby who bakes at lightning speed...when not napping in flour sacks<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Spring</strong>\u00a0\u2013 A hyperactive kitten delivering orders in 3 seconds flat (and breaking 2 plates)<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Scar</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The rugged explorer who hunts rare mushroom ingredients between shifts<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/d0a3d30bb129c2ad690116381b7996fe.poster.avif?t=1768972687\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/d0a3d30bb129c2ad690116381b7996fe.webm?t=1768972687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/d0a3d30bb129c2ad690116381b7996fe.mp4?t=1768972687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Strategy</strong><br>Ditch spreadsheets! Our &quot;Claw-culus&quot; system lets you:<br>\u2713 Rotate seasonal menus by catching falling cherry blossoms<br>\u2713 Boost tips by assigning vocal cats to sing for customers<br>\u2713 Design obstacle courses to optimize serving routes<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.poster.avif?t=1768972687\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.webm?t=1768972687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f12b71a5765fc873d4a5a8fb83e75562.mp4?t=1768972687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest of Whiskered Wonders</strong><br>Send adventuring parties beyond the tea fields to:<br>\u2022 Decode recipes from a poetry-reciting owl<br>\u2022 Trade fish cookies with underground mole merchants<br>\u2022 Uncover why the river flows with lavender honey at midnight...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.poster.avif?t=1768972687\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.webm?t=1768972687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/f777263929e75c12b830c0daa954157e.mp4?t=1768972687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaking News!</strong><br>Our first playable Demo will arrive soon!<br>Join our playtest event \u2013 let's build <strong><i>Purr Plate</i></strong> together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676490?t=1768972687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/4bf8ae99b4ac8b2dd8fbfd7788d4e783863020fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768972687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/50fb874fc78d3c9c6e23f62dcaf4ab459d858142/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768972687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/50fb874fc78d3c9c6e23f62dcaf4ab459d858142/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768972687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4056210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Purr\u00a0Plate</i></strong>\u00a0\u2013 Craft Your Wholesome Feline Picnic Paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come and build your dream <i>Purr Plate</i>!</strong><br>In this sunlit feline paradise, become the owner of a one-of-a-kind restaurant designed with your dream &quot;Purr Plate&quot;! Team up with over 100+ quirky cat staffers--from paw-kneading bakers to servers tumbling adorably over their own tails--to create your purrfect woodland caf\u00e9!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i